//
// ChannelMap for EPG Daemon (sngtv template)
// --------------------------
//
// Format:
//  <source>:<extid>[:<merge>[:<vps>]] = <cid1>[,<cid2>[,<cid3>]]
//
// <source>   'vdr' or the source name provided by a plugin
// <extid>    000 for vdr or the channel id used by the external EPG provider
// <merge>    Merge DVB and external EPG for this channel
//            { 0, 1, 2 } (default 1, the default for source 'vdr' is 0)
// <vps>      { y, Y, n, N, 0, 1 } (default 0)
// <cid>      VDR ChannelID (Src-NID-TID-SID)
//
// Tip: run 'sngtv-channels -c <channels.conf>' inside the container to auto-match your VDR channels
//
//
// sngtv
// --------------------------
//
